3890-d310712-r724991078-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Hard to impress this feeling", "text": "Oh, it's a very energetic place... So interesting, and so impressive and tragical for me, European man. There are many people chanting mantras, making rituals in the smoke of cremation fires, monkeys looking for something tasty, flowers and leaves, old and new buildings. But the most impressive thing is a house for old and poor people... if you are brave to see all of this, it may change your life.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-11-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "49D26BCA1522CA0576381816D5436170", "name": "Максим Берестовский", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Korsar108", "username": "Korsar108", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/f3/3a/f9/korsar108.jpg", "contribution_count": 14, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 298484, "location_name": "Moscow", "location_name_detailed": "Moscow, Russia"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-11-08", "published_at_date": "2019-11-08"}, {"review_id": 724680103, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r724680103-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Great place to visit!!", "text": "paahupatinath temple is must important place  to visit for all human being, \nwhere  you can enjoy  with  many  hindu  cultural  activities !!", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "business", "stay_date": "2019-11-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "EE510F94D68DACEAA43EE4A6A159D433", "name": "Kedarmani K"