", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "CF787F4C9D9BA37C9281FA4C7198B9FD", "name": "bakul_shroff", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/bakul_shroff", "username": "bakul_shroff", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-s/01/e6/5e/bc/bakul-shroff.jpg", "contribution_count": 275, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 297613, "location_name": "Vadodara", "location_name_detailed": "Vadodara, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-11-07", "published_at_date": "2019-11-07"}, {"review_id": 724463437, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r724463437-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "It Is What It Is", "text": "Not sure I'd put this down as a tourist site, seems very disrespectful and I found it intrusive to be watching as people cremated their loved ones - albeit from the other side of the river.  Fascinating to know about it but the guide could have explained from afar without us having to be there.\nOh and it has more monkeys running around that the so called monkey temple so beware!", "review_tip": null, "rating": 3, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "8760AFE3852A9F831331064FE2E6B12E", "name": "dianedinky", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/dianedinky", "username": "dianedinky", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e8/5b/default-avatar-2020-61.jpg", "contribution_count": 2756, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 186530, "location_name": "Dunfermline", "location_name_detailed": "Dunfermline, United Kingdom"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-11-06", "published_at_date": "2019-11-07"}, {"review_id": 724277363, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r724277363-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "beautiful and mesmirising experience", "text": "This was my second visit to the place. The mandir is divine and is beautifully maintained by the government. It was a beautiful experience of puja. the best thing was animals were also allowed in the temple premises and were given respect.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-09-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "18CB8A7A2F3415C43AB466A322DEC313", "name": "komal r", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/komalr150", "username": "komalr150", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/11/d6/bf/39/komal-r.jpg", "contribution_count": 4, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-11-06", "published_at_date": "2019-11-06"}, {"review_id": 724194040, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r724194040-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Inspiring", "text": "Not a lot to see, but what there is, is well worth it.  You get a calming effect just walking around it.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "4482A0605489DEA74604ACF7A1AB97AD", "name": "Linda D", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/lindadZ5478OG", "username": "lindadZ5478OG", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f3/e4/default-avatar-2020-30.jpg", "contribution_count": 54, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 298570, "location_name": "Kuala Lumpur", "location_name_detailed": "Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-11-06", "published_at_date": "2019-11-06"}, {"review_id": 723759672, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r723759672-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Holy place of Shiva", "text": "5 faces of shiva and they are open at different times, we went in around 2pm and was able to see all the entrances of shivas face. it is a must visit and had an amazing experience", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-06-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "98AD6020BB105618C9BDC9F0978D7619", "name": "Vijay", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Simhavij", "username": "Simhavij", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1d/7f/08/82/simhavij.jpg", "contribution_count": 320, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 304556, "location_name": "Chennai (Madras)", "location_name_detailed": "Chennai (Madras), India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-11-04", "published_at_date": "2019-11-04"}, {"review_id": 723757034, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r723757034-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Holy Place", "text": "the complex and the crematorium is a very central attraction and restrictions are in place not to use mobiles inside as they are strict. plenty of shiv lings inside and you may be able to see a funeral at the same time on the banks of bagmati river", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-06-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "98AD6020BB105618C9BDC9F0978D7619", "name": "Vijay", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Simhavij", "username": "Simhavij", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1d/7f/08/82/simhavij.jpg", "contribution_count": 320, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 304556, "location_name": "Chennai (Madras)", "location_name_detailed": "Chennai (Madras), India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-11-04", "published_at_date": "2019-11-04"}, {"review_id": 723664589, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r723664589-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "An usually experience", "text": "It's a place where the Nepalese cremate their departed. I saw a body being prepared but did not take a photo. I feel like it was a very intimate rite for families only. This is a must visit place.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "E2FC463D30B3AFFA7C4C839FE3B0F5BF", "name": "acablyn", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/acablyn", "username": "acablyn", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/eb/6a/38/acablyn.jpg", "contribution_count": 46, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 298573, "location_name": "Manila", "location_name_detailed": "Manila, Philippines"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/eb/81/bc/body-being-cremated.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2019-11-04", "published_at_date": "2019-11-04"}, {"review_id": 723602802, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r723602802-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Fascinating and Disturbing", "text": "Pashupati Nath is a Hindu Temple.  The architecture and history is interesting and I would recommend a visit.  Please be aware that it is a site actively used for preparing and cremating those recently deceased and honoring the dead.  While tourist are only allowed across the river, this might be upsetting for some.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "A54FBB59E5849665BD219A6C7BE0FECB", "name": "Susan M", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Y6624OZsusanm", "username": "Y6624OZsusanm", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/0b/ef/59/32/susan-m.jpg", "contribution_count": 200, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 52024, "location_name": "Portland", "location_name_detailed": "Portland, Oregon"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-11-04", "published_at_date": "2019-11-04"}, {"review_id": 723594662, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r723594662-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Fascinating place with much to see!", "text": "First, the template and surrounding area requires a bit of a walk - perhaps 1/4 mile.  Once back to the area, watching the Hindu traditional cremations along the river is riveting. You don't need to stay too long to see one start or end. Get a guide for this site so you can really get a feel for the process including those that come to die touching the river.  ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "33AF5CD2425A8C30C165E20405EA5C68", "name": "Karl B", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/karlb485", "username": "karlb485", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e6/ea/default-avatar-2020-54.jpg", "contribution_count": 58, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-11-03", "published_at_date": "2019-11-04"}, {"review_id": 723420472, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r723420472-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Taken Aback", "text": "I didn't realize this was the site of the local outdoor crematory.   I didn't stay long and had mixed feelings about even being there.  Two bodies were prepared and cremated along the river...it was difficult to adjust to the smoke and smell.  Tha temple and site aren’t conducive to tourists, especially when only Hindus were allowed into the main temple.  It’s a natural; cycle of life so it may not bother others who go.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 3, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "4E43CA31F4B886950141BAA9873DFD04", "name": "Andy C", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/M384KNandyc", "username": "M384KNandyc", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f4/5d/default-avatar-2020-32.jpg", "contribution_count": 70, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 60982, "location_name": "Honolulu", "location_name_detailed": "Honolulu, Hawaii"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-11-03", "published_at_date": "2019-11-03"}, {"review_id": 723386450, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r723386450-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Special Place", "text": "If you want to experience what life is like at the end of life then this is a very special place. Go in and leave your western thoughts outside the gate and experience life as lived by others.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "646C5B99224D02B760C86C7C5FA3A867", "name": "Herbie C", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Herbie20023", "username": "Herbie20023", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f2/eb/default-avatar-2020-27.jpg", "contribution_count": 40, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 255055, "location_name": "Australia", "location_name_detailed": "Australia"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-11-03", "published_at_date": "2019-11-03"}, {"review_id": 722676375, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r722676375-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Both sides of the river ", "text": "Life is embraced on one side of the river, death on the other. Bring your sense of wonder and leave a piece of your heart. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "EE319D5D447B9B4DFDAF38C360C65B88", "name": "roamurown", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/alesiadugan", "username": "alesiadugan", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e9/60/default-avatar-2020-64.jpg", "contribution_count": 12, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 33273, "location_name": "Willits", "location_name_detailed": "Willits, California"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-10-31", "published_at_date": "2019-10-31"}, {"review_id": 722237264, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r722237264-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Pashupatinath temple Kathmandu", "text": "Pasupathinath temple is one of the holiest place for Hindus and Lord Shiva is main deity. It is situated near Bagmati River in the heart of Kathmandu city. Temple is opening early in the morning and devotees can view from all four sides only during particular timings. Bairava and other deities are also there in the complex.  We had nice dharsan on a full moon day.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "D64066FDC93A9213B8AC06C1053D102D", "name": "Balasubramanian R", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/balasubramanian16847", "username": "balasubramanian16847", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/0a/ae/09/09/balasubramanian16847.jpg", "contribution_count": 801, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 304556, "location_name": "Chennai (Madras)", "location_name_detailed": "Chennai (Madras), India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-10-29", "published_at_date": "2019-10-29"}, {"review_id": 722168502, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r722168502-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Small but nice temple", "text": "In contrast to my expectations, the temple is small but has 4 Gates and if you want to pray God Shankar from all 4 Gates, you need to go between 8 am and 11 30am. Rest of the time Gates open for few minutes. Only one gate remains open for the Darshan time. 6 am to 12 noon and 4 pm to 8 pm. Lots of small temples around. River bagmati (in a pretty bad dirty shape) passing behind. However temple is clean and not very crowded. Queue of 50persons when we visited but may be due to Hindu New year day. There is a place with multiple shivlings which requires parikramna. Shoes counter is outside temple premises and is free so do not leave your shoes with any shopkeeper who may attract you with such offers. Payment RS 100 for Saarc countries more for others. Photography not allowed", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "1C17AB81ACB4C5AEC60ADAFF09F1D079", "name": "Drurman", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Drurman", "username": "Drurman", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/30/2b/c7/dc/caption.jpg", "contribution_count": 356, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 297608, "location_name": "Ahmedabad", "location_name_detailed": "Ahmedabad, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/da/a4/dc/img20191028121149-largejpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/da/a4/de/img20191028112304-largejpg.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2019-10-29", "published_at_date": "2019-10-29"}, {"review_id": 722046905, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r722046905-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Highlight of Kathmandu ", "text": "Could spend the day watching cremations, activity, sadhu’s, monkeys, etc. Fascinating and atmospheric. Didn’t bother with guide, just took my time to explore. Interesting walking there and back from Thamel area. Highly recommended. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "1DC6ECE83EBE5CC75C9EB02540663339", "name": "Akdor1", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Akdor1", "username": "Akdor1", "avatar": null, "contribution_count": 35, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 186338, "location_name": "London", "location_name_detailed": "London, United Kingdom"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-10-28", "published_at_date": "2019-10-28"}, {"review_id": 720991127, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r720991127-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "different culture", "text": "Different culture, could not be the best to see but feel its culture what we taught and give . Life ending place to explore different ways of celebration ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "D65713B07C877F1724536AE78432B3CF", "name": "skl b", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/sklb2014", "username": "sklb2014", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f3/e4/default-avatar-2020-30.jpg", "contribution_count": 24, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 186338, "location_name": "London", "location_name_detailed": "London, United Kingdom"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-10-24", "published_at_date": "2019-10-24"}], "rating_distribution": {